From: =?utf-8?q?Jeremy_B=C3=ADcha?= <jbicha@ubuntu.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 14:19:51 +0200
Subject: Revert "users: Disable keeping data if deleting homed user"

Revert "users: Disable auto-login for homed users"

This reverts commit b54ee983acba3180f346f33084f50e2ee0a95c02.
This reverts commit abdfb2ca3ace1dac047f898de3cc872eed9602f7.

Debian Unstable does not yet have accountsservice 26
---
 meson.build                          |  3 +--
 panels/system/users/cc-user-page.blp |  1 +
 panels/system/users/cc-user-page.c   | 18 +-----------------
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 80861c1..1544a4c 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -222,8 +222,7 @@ gmobile_dep = dependency(
 config_h.set('HAVE_GMOBILE', gmobile_dep.found(),
              description: 'Define to 1 if gmobile is available')
 
-accounts_dep = dependency('accountsservice', version: '>= 26.27.3')
-
+accounts_dep = dependency('accountsservice', version: '>= 23.11.69')
 colord_dep = dependency('colord', version: '>= 0.1.34')
 gdk_pixbuf_dep = dependency('gdk-pixbuf-2.0', version: '>= 2.23.0')
 gio_dep = dependency('gio-2.0')
diff --git a/panels/system/users/cc-user-page.blp b/panels/system/users/cc-user-page.blp
index b6b808a..8e1381e 100644
--- a/panels/system/users/cc-user-page.blp
+++ b/panels/system/users/cc-user-page.blp
